Until the merger is approved by all parties involved, Digital and
Compaq are restricted by SEC regulations on how much they
can say. Most of what can be said (responses to rumors, etc.)
is already available at http://www.digital.com/quash .

In Eckhard Pfeiffer's letter to DIGITAL customers, at
http://www.digital.com/quash/pfeiffer.htm :

 | When the merger is completed, Compaq will be absolutely
 | committed to the continued success of the DIGITAL leadership
 | in 64 bit technology with Alpha microprocessors, DIGITAL
