Hello Jonathan.
        Yes,  Reg-fail is the only led lit on mine as well. 

        the 2.5v power supply assembly also has +5v at 20A,
        -5v at 1.2A, and  12v at 10A. so it's worth testing
        these rails to see if they are working.  (+/-5v are 
        dead on my psu.) 

        the 5v power supply assembly also has  +/-15v which 
        will also give a  reg-fail if not woring correctly.

        on the 5v psu, connector j3 on the top panel has 
        the +/-15v  and ground rails..

        on the 2.5v psu, the extra supply rails appear on j1

        you will probably  find that there is  nothing wrong 
        with the 2.5 supply rail, (so no alarm led), but the
        fault will be on one of the  other regulators inside
        the 2.5v assembly. (or 5v assembly)..
        
